	Fixes <https://savannah.gnu.org/bugs/?68845>.

2026-11-01  G. Branden Robinson <g.branden.robinson@gmail.com>

	[troff]: Implement new `.sv` read-only register.

	* src/roff/troff/div.cpp (class saved_vertical_space_reg): New
	file-local class handles dynamically computed `saved_space`
	amount.  (The class `readonly_reg` is not appropriate because
	its constructor requires a parameter of type `int`.
	`saved_space` is of type `vunits`.)
	(saved_vertical_space_reg::get_string): Retrieve the amount.
	(init_div_requests): Wire up `.sv` register name to object of
	this new class.

